        <description><![CDATA[<p style="margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;">Employees have a duty to report any workplace health and safety complaints to their manager and to jointly assess them, as outlined in the <a style="color: #0563c1; text-decoration: underline;" href="https://hoccdc.sharepoint.com/sites/info/en/services/hoc-health-and-wellness/Documents/OHS-internal-complaint-resolution-procedure-e.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Internal Complaint Resolution Procedure</a>.</p>
<p style="margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;">The purpose of this process is to outline the graduated series of steps used to resolve workplace health and safety hazardous situations as well as any contraventions of the <a style="color: #0563c1; text-decoration: underline;" href="https://laws-lois.justice.gc.ca/eng/acts/l-2/" rel="nofollow">Canada Labour Code, Part II</a> (the Code) and its regulations, including the <a style="color: #0563c1; text-decoration: underline;" href="https://laws-lois.justice.gc.ca/eng/regulations/SOR-86-304/page-1.html" rel="nofollow">Canada Occupational Health and Safety Regulations</a> (the Regulations).</p>
<p style="margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;"><strong>Definitions </strong></p>
<p style="margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;"><strong>Danger:</strong> Any hazard, condition or activity that could reasonably be expected to be an imminent or serious threat to the life or health of a person exposed to it before the hazard or condition can be corrected or the activity altered.</p>
<p style="margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;"><strong>Hazardous situation:</strong> A source of potential damage, harm or adverse health effects on something or someone.</p>
<p style="margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;"><strong>Health and safety complaint:</strong> The reporting of a workplace health and safety hazardous situation and/or any contravention of Part II of the Code and its Regulations.</p>
<p><span style="font-size: 10pt;">For post exposure to a chemical or information pertaining to a chemical product, you may refer to the <a title="SDS Repository" href="https://webhouseofcommons77ff9fjquf.maerixium.com/paratoxxpress/binder/default/EN/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">SDS Repository</a> for further information.</span></p>]]></description>
